  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Place peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, then spread out evenly. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the pumpkin between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-eeb61200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse half the chickpeas. Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-9a204d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine baby spinach leaves, shredded cabbage mix and half the plant-based aioli.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, then season with salt and pepper. Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-eb523020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the pumpkin has 10 minutes remaining, heat a medium saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook garlic, paprika spice blend and tomato paste, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-22ac7f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add chickpeas, the water, the plant-based butter and the brown sugar to the paprika mixture.\n• Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat and add the honey. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-0a38bc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Divide paprika chickpeas, haloumi and roasted pumpkin between bowls. Serve with slaw.\n• Sprinkle with almonds and top with a dollop of remaining plant-based aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d035963fcd98f40ac8/step-49b42850.jpg"
    }
  ]
